td><span class="relative inline " data-prov="cell:PSI-69:main:L40:C5"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  " aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="71.3 kPa. Show where this number comes from">71.3 kPa</button></span></td></tr></tbody></table></section><section class="border-b border-line py-6 [break-inside:avoid]"><h2 class="eyebrow mb-3">Sources</h2><ol class="space-y-2 text-xs"><li class="grid grid-cols-[24px_1fr] gap-2"><span class="text-ink-3">1</span><span><span class="text-ink-2">Derived calculation:</span> probe grid axes (pressure in psi; kPa by psi_to_kpa) v1 <span class="mono text-ink-3">[probe:axes]</span></span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[24px_1fr] gap-2"><span class="text-ink-3">2</span><span><span class="text-ink-2">Derived calculation:</span> nearness count on the probe grid, all fuel classes and sources v1 <span class="mono text-ink-3">[probe:1:total]</span></span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[24px_1fr] gap-2"><span class="text-ink-3">3</span><span><span class="text-ink-2">Derived calculation:</span> nearness count on the probe grid v1 <span class="mono text-ink-3">[probe:1:gas:psi_table]</span></span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[24px_1fr] gap-2"><span class="text-ink-3">4</span><span><span class="text-ink-2">Derived calculation:</span> nearness count on the probe grid v1 <span class="mono text-ink-3">[probe:1:gas:published_paper]</span></span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[24px_1fr] gap-2"><span class="text-ink-3">5</span><span><span class="text-ink-2">Derived calculation:</span> O2 within threshold, pressure not recorded, per O2 column of the probe grid v1 <span class="mono text-ink-3">[probe:1:o2match:gas]</span></span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[24px_1fr] gap-2"><span class="text-ink-3">6</span><span><span class="text-ink-2">Derived calculation:</span> nearness count on the probe grid v1 <span class="mono text-ink-3">[probe:1:droplet:psi_table]</span></span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[24px_1fr] gap-2"><span class="text-ink-3">7</span><span><span class="text-ink-2">Derived calculation:</span> nearness count on the probe grid v1 <span class="mono text-ink-3">[probe:1:droplet:published_paper]</span></span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[24px_1fr] gap-2"><span class="text-ink-3">8</span><span><span class="text-ink-2">Derived calculation:</span> O2 within threshold, pressure not recorded, per O2 column of the probe grid v1 <span class="mono text-ink-3">[probe:1:o2match:droplet]</span></span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[24px_1fr] gap-2"><span class="text-ink-3">9</span><span><span class="text-ink-2">Derived calculation:</span> nearness count on the probe grid v1 <span class="mono text-ink-3">[probe:1:solid:psi_table]</span></span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[24px_1fr] gap-2"><span class="text-ink-3">10</span><span><span class="text-ink-2">Derived calculation:</span> nearness count on the probe grid v1 <span class="mono text-ink-3">[probe:1:solid:published_paper]</span></span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[24px_1fr] gap-2"><span class="text-ink-3">11</span><span><span class="text-ink-2">Derived calculation:</span> O2 within threshold, pressure not recorded, per O2 column of the probe grid v1 <span class="mono text-ink-3">[probe:1:o2match:solid]</span></span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[24px_1fr] gap-2"><span class="text-ink-3">12</span><span><span class="text-ink-2">Derived calculation:</span> nearness count on the probe grid v1 <span class="mono text-ink-3">[probe:1:emulator:psi_table]</span></span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[24px_1fr] gap-2"><span class="text-ink-3">13</span><span><span class="text-ink-2">Derived calculation:</span> nearness count on the probe grid v1 <span class="mono text-ink-3">[probe:1:emulator:published_paper]</span></span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[24px_1fr] gap-2"><span class="text-ink-3">14</span><span><span class="text-ink-2">Derived calculation:</span> O2 within threshold, pressure not recorded, per O2 column of the probe grid v1 <span class="mono text-ink-3">[probe:1:o2match:emulator]</span></span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[24px_1fr] gap-2"><span class="text-ink-3">15</span><span><span class="text-ink-2">Derived calculation:</span> cantera_hp_equilibrium_stoich_ch4 v1 <span class="mono text-ink-3">[ft:c8_2_34]</span></span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[24px_1fr] gap-2"><span class="text-ink-3">16</span><span><span class="text-ink-2">Derived calculation:</span> access gap step count v1 <span class="mono text-ink-3">[gap:psi:0]</span></span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[24px_1fr] gap-2"><span class="text-ink-3">17</span><span><span class="text-ink-2">Derived calculation:</span> access gap step count v1 <span class="mono text-ink-3">[gap:psi:1]</span></span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[24px_1fr] gap-2"><span class="text-ink-3">18</span><span><span class="text-ink-2">Derived calculation:</span> access gap step count v1 <span class="mono text-ink-3">[gap:psi:2]</span></span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[24px_1fr] gap-2"><span class="text-ink-3">19</span><span><span class="text-ink-2">Derived calculation:</span> access gap step count v1 <span class="mono text-ink-3">[gap:psi:3]</span></span></li></ol><p class="mt-4 text-xs text-ink-2">Cite the dataset as: Project Redshift (2026). Redshift microgravity fire evidence dataset, version 2026-11-14+86f35c56f2e0. Derived from NASA Physical Sciences Informatics (cite each investigation by its DOI).</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-ink-2">PSI investigations cited by the tests above: <span><a class="mono underline underline-offset-2" href="https://doi.org/10.60555/cyt1-kh64">10.60555/cyt1-kh64</a></span><span>, <a class="mono underline underline-offset-2" href="https://doi.org/10.60555/mbq8-0451">10.60555/mbq8-0451</a></span></p></section></article>"`;

exports[`screens > the panel between candidates 1`] = `"<div class="grid min-h-[calc(100vh-56px)] grid-cols-1 lg:h-[calc(100vh-56px)] lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_400px] lg:grid-rows-1 lg:overflow-hidden"><section class="flex min-h-0 flex-col" aria-label="The oxygen and pressure plane"><header class="flex flex-col gap-3 px-4 pb-2 pt-4 lg:px-6"><h1 class="max-w-4xl text-heading" aria-live="polite">Near the candidate habitat atmospheres, PSI&#x27;s tables hold gas and droplet tests, but no solid burns.</h1><div class="-mx-4 flex items-center gap-2 overflow-x-auto px-4 pb-1 pt-1 [scrollbar-width:none] sm:mx-0 sm:flex-wrap sm:overflow-visible sm:px-0 sm:pt-0"><button type="button" role="switch" aria-checked="false" class="chip flex-none whitespace-nowrap " id="tour-solids"><span class="switch" aria-checked="false" aria-hidden="true"></span> Solids only</button><span class="mx-1 hidden h-6 w-px bg-[color:var(--line)] sm:block" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="flex flex-none gap-1 sm:flex-wrap" role="group" aria-label="Snap to a candidate atmosphere"><button type="button" class="chip h-8 whitespace-nowrap px-3 text-xs" aria-pressed="false">14.7 psi / 21%</button><button type="button" class="chip h-8 whitespace-nowrap px-3 text-xs" aria-pressed="false">10.2 psi / 26.5%</button><button type="button" class="chip h-8 whitespace-nowrap px-3 text-xs" aria-pressed="false">10.2 psi / 30%</button><button type="button" class="chip h-8 whitespace-nowrap px-3 text-xs" aria-pressed="false">8.2 psi / 34%</button><button type="button" class="chip h-8 whitespace-nowrap px-3 text-xs" aria-pressed="false">4.3 psi / 100%</button></span><span class="ml-auto flex flex-none items-center gap-2"><div><button type="button" class="btn" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="true">Layers</button></div><span class="seg" role="group" aria-label="Zoom"><button type="button" aria-pressed="true">Habitat range</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false">Whole plane</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false">All tests</button></span><button type="button" class="btn" aria-pressed="false" title="Select an area (B)">Select area</button></span></div></header><div class="relative h-[62vh] min-h-[420px] px-2 pb-2 lg:h-auto lg:flex-1 lg:px-4" id="tour-plane"><div class="relative h-full w-full select-none"><svg data-chart="true" width="960" height="640" aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 block"><defs><pattern id="hatch-plane" width="7" height="7" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse" patternTransform="rotate(45)"><line x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="7" stroke="var(--hatch)" stroke-width="1"></line></pattern><clipPath id="plane-clip"><rect width="848" height="464"></rect></clipPath><clipPath id="plane-clip-glyphs"><rect x="-18" y="-18" width="884" height="500"></rect></clipPath></defs><g transform="translate(56,16)"><rect width="848" height="464" fill="var(--surface-2)" stroke="var(--line)"></rect><line x1="0" x2="848" y1="464" y2="464" stroke="var(--line)"></line><line x1="0" x2="848" y1="324.82739009111276" y2="324.82739009111276" stroke="var(--line)"></line><line x1="0" x2="848" y1="227.58865769886194" y2="227.58865769886194" stroke="var(--line)"></line><line x1="0" x2="848" y1="64.76499454871876" y2="64.76499454871876" stroke="var(--line)"></line><line y1="0" y2="464" x1="28.266666666666666" x2="28.266666666666666" stroke="var(--line)"></line><line y1="0" y2="464" x1="84.80000000000001" x2="84.80000000000001" stroke="var(--line)"></line><line y1="0" y2="464" x1="141.33333333333331" x2="141.33333333333331" stroke="var(--line)"></line><line y1="0" y2="464" x1="197.86666666666667" x2="197.86666666666667" stroke="var(--line)"></line><line y1="0" y2="464" x1="254.39999999999998" x2="254.39999999999998" stroke="var(--line)"></line><line y1="0" y2="464" x1="310.93333333333334" x2="310.93333333333334" stroke="var(--line)"></line><line y1="0" y2="464" x1="367.4666666666667" x2="367.4666666666667" stroke="var(--line)"></line><line y1="0" y2="464" x1="424" x2="424" stroke="var(--line)"></line><line y1="0" y2="464" x1="480.5333333333333" x2="480.5333333333333" stroke="var(--line)"></line><line y1="0" y2="464" x1="537.0666666666666" x2="537.0666666666666" stroke="var(--line)"></line><line y1="0" y2="464" x1="593.5999999999999" x2="593.5999999999999" stroke="var(--line)"></line><line y1="0" y2="464" x1="650.1333333333333" x2="650.1333333333333" stroke="var(--line)"></line><line y1="0" y2="464" x1="706.6666666666667" x2="706.6666666666667" stroke="var(--line)"></line><line y1="0" y2="464" x1="763.2" x2="763.2" stroke="var(--line)"></line><line y1="0" y2="464" x1="819.7333333333333" x2="819.7333333333333" stroke="var(--line)"></line><g clip-path="url(#plane-clip)"><g class="layer" data-on="true"><rect x="91.86666666666667" y="538.2130913933884" width="155.46666666666667" height="148.42618278677696" fill="url(#hatch-plane)" opacity="0.4" style="transition:opacity var(--t-move) var(--ease-out)"></rect><rect x="247.33333333333334" y="538.2130913933884" width="127.19999999999996" height="148.42618278677696" fill="url(#hatch-plane)" opacity="0.4" style="transition:opacity var(--t-move) var(--ease-out)"></rect><rect x="374.5333333333333" y="538.2130913933884" width="106" height="148.42618278677696" fill="url(#hatch-plane)" opacity="0.4" style="transition:opacity var(--t-move) var(--ease-out)"></rect><rect x="480.5333333333333" y="538.2130913933884" width="141.33333333333337" height="148.42618278677696" fill="url(#hatch-plane)" opacity="0.4" style="transition:opacity var(--t-move) var(--ease-out)"></rect><rect x="621.8666666666667" y="538.2130913933884" width="226.13333333333333" height="148.42618278677696" fill="url(#hatch-plane)" opacity="0.4" style="transition:opacity var(--t-move) var(--ease-out)"></rect><rect x="848" y="538.2130913933884" width="848" height="148.42618278677696" fill="url(#hatch-plane)" opacity="0.4" style="transition:opacity var(--t-move) var(--ease-out)"></rect><rect x="848" y="394.4136950455564" width="848" height="143