>Has a solid material ever been burned near a candidate Moon-base atmosphere?</button><button type="button" class="chip h-auto whitespace-normal py-1 text-left text-xs" aria-pressed="false">Why can&#x27;t the ACME BRE data be placed on the trade map?</button><button type="button" class="chip h-auto whitespace-normal py-1 text-left text-xs" aria-pressed="false">What did FLEX show about carbon dioxide suppression near 10.4 psi?</button><button type="button" class="chip h-auto whitespace-normal py-1 text-left text-xs" aria-pressed="false">Which atmosphere should NASA choose for the Moon base?</button><button type="button" class="chip h-auto whitespace-normal py-1 text-left text-xs" aria-pressed="false">Is there partial-gravity fire data for the Moon?</button></div><div aria-live="polite" class="mt-4"></div></div></section><p class="border-t border-line px-5 py-4 text-xs text-ink-3">Redshift informs a decision; it does not rank or recommend an atmosphere. Empty means unknown, never safe.</p><div class="sticky bottom-0 z-10 mt-auto border-t border-line bg-[color:var(--surface)] px-3 py-2"><div role="status" aria-live="polite" class="pointer-events-none absolute bottom-full right-3 mb-2"></div><nav aria-label="Take this point further"><ul class="grid grid-cols-5 gap-1"><li><a class="flex h-12 w-full flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-md text-xs font-medium text-ink-2 transition-colors hover:bg-[color:var(--surface-3)] hover:text-ink disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:text-ink-3 disabled:hover:bg-transparent" href="/dossiers/candidate/c8_2_34"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M1.75 4.25a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h3.5l1.5 1.75h5.5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v6.75a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H2.75a1 1 0 0 1-1-1Z"></path></svg>Dossier</a></li><li><a class="flex h-12 w-full flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-md text-xs font-medium text-ink-2 transition-colors hover:bg-[color:var(--surface-3)] hover:text-ink disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:text-ink-3 disabled:hover:bg-transparent" href="/evidence?near=34,8.2,1"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.25 4h.01M2.25 8h.01M2.25 12h.01M5.25 4h8.5M5.25 8h8.5M5.25 12h8.5"></path></svg>Tests</a></li><li><a class="flex h-12 w-full flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-md text-xs font-medium text-ink-2 transition-colors hover:bg-[color:var(--surface-3)] hover:text-ink disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:text-ink-3 disabled:hover:bg-transparent" href="/compare?pts=34,8.2;26.5,10.2&amp;m=1"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 5.25h10M9.5 2.75 12 5.25 9.5 7.75"></path><path d="M14 10.75H4M6.5 8.25 4 10.75l2.5 2.5"></path></svg>Compare</a></li><li><a class="flex h-12 w-full flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-md text-xs font-medium text-ink-2 transition-colors hover:bg-[color:var(--surface-3)] hover:text-ink disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:text-ink-3 disabled:hover:bg-transparent" href="/brief?o2=34&amp;p=8.2"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9.25 1.75H4.25a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v10.5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h7.5a1 1 0 0 0 1-1V4.75Z"></path><path d="M9.25 1.75v3h3.5M5.75 8.5h4.5M5.75 11h4.5"></path></svg>Brief</a></li><li><button type="button" class="flex h-12 w-full flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-md text-xs font-medium text-ink-2 transition-colors hover:bg-[color:var(--surface-3)] hover:text-ink disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:text-ink-3 disabled:hover:bg-transparent"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 10V1.75M5.25 4.5 8 1.75l2.75 2.75"></path><path d="M3.75 7.5v5.75a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h6.5a1 1 0 0 0 1-1V7.5"></path></svg>Share</button></li></ul></nav></div></div></aside></div>"`;

exports[`screens > the plane with solids only 1`] = `"<div class="grid min-h-[calc(100vh-56px)] grid-cols-1 lg:h-[calc(100vh-56px)] lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_400px] lg:grid-rows-1 lg:overflow-hidden"><section class="flex min-h-0 flex-col" aria-label="The oxygen and pressure plane"><header class="flex flex-col gap-3 px-4 pb-2 pt-4 lg:px-6"><h1 class="max-w-4xl text-heading" aria-live="polite">No solid burn in PSI&#x27;s tables records pressure. <span class="text-ink-2">Of <span class="relative inline " data-prov="gap:psi:0"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="263. Show where this number comes from">263</button></span> solid-fuel burn rows, <span class="relative inline " data-prov="gap:psi:1"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="129. Show where this number comes from">129</button></span> record oxygen and <span class="relative inline " data-prov="gap:psi:2"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="0. Show where this number comes from">0</button></span> record pressure.</span></h1><div class="-mx-4 flex items-center gap-2 overflow-x-auto px-4 pb-1 pt-1 [scrollbar-width:none] sm:mx-0 sm:flex-wrap sm:overflow-visible sm:px-0 sm:pt-0"><button type="button" role="switch" aria-checked="true" class="chip flex-none whitespace-nowrap border-[col