alog" aria-label="2,570 K. Show where this number comes from">2,570 K</button></span></dd></div><div><dt class="eyebrow">Prebreathe</dt><dd class="text-ink-2">Awaiting check</dd></div><div><dt class="eyebrow">Step</dt><dd data-setting="">1x</dd></div></dl><button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-quiet flex-none" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls=":R4i:">More<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 3.5 10.5 8 6 12.5" transform="rotate(90 8 8)"></path></svg></button></div><div id=":R4i:" hidden="" class="mt-3 space-y-4"><div><h3 class="eyebrow mb-1">Flame temperature</h3><p class="text-sm"><span class="relative inline " data-prov="ft:c8_2_34"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  italic" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="2,570 K. Show where this number comes from">2,570 K</button></span> <span class="text-ink-2">computed for this atmosphere.</span></p><p class="mt-1 text-xs italic text-ink-2">Stoichiometric methane. Explains how hot a flame can get; it does not predict ignition or spread.</p></div><div><h3 class="eyebrow mb-1">Prebreathe</h3><p class="text-sm text-ink-2">A published figure has been found for this atmosphere and is waiting for a team member to verify it against the source (finding <span class="mono">FND-EA-PB-8.2</span>). It appears here once verified.</p></div><div><h3 class="eyebrow mb-1">Nearness step size</h3><div><div role="radiogroup" aria-label="Nearness step size" class="relative flex h-10 items-center"><span class="absolute left-3 right-3 top-1/2 h-px bg-[color:var(--line-strong)]" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="absolute top-1/2 h-4 w-4 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full border-2 border-[color:var(--accent)] bg-[color:var(--surface)] transition-[left] duration-base ease-out" style="left:calc(12px + (100% - 24px) * 0.5)" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="relative flex w-full justify-between"><button type="button" role="radio" aria-checked="false" tabindex="-1" class="mt-8 w-12 text-center text-xs text-ink-3 hover:text-ink" data-setting="">0.75x</button><button type="button" role="radio" aria-checked="true" tabindex="0" class="mt-8 w-12 text-center text-xs font-semibold text-ink" data-setting="">1x</button><button type="button" role="radio" aria-checked="false" tabindex="-1" class="mt-8 w-12 text-center text-xs text-ink-3 hover:text-ink" data-setting="">1.5x</button></span></div><p class="mt-5 text-xs text-ink-2">Near means within <span class="relative inline " data-prov="params:nearness"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  " aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="1.5 steps. Show where this number comes from">1.5 steps</button></span> of the point. At <span data-setting="">1x</span> one step is <span class="relative inline " data-prov="params:nearness"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  " aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="5 O2 points. Show where this number comes from">5 O2 points</button></span> or a pressure ratio of <span class="relative inline " data-prov="params:nearness"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  " aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="1.25. Show where this number comes from">1.25</button></span>. The step sizes are a judgement; counts at each stop are computed by the build. <a class="underline underline-offset-2" href="/methods?open=nearness">Why these steps</a></p></div></div></div></section><section class="border-t border-line px-5 py-3" aria-label="Nearest tests"><details class="group"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center gap-2 text-sm text-ink-2 hover:text-ink [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" class="flex-none transition-transform duration-base group-open:rotate-90"><path d="M6 3.5 10.5 8 6 12.5"></path></svg>Nearest tests</summary><ul class="mt-2 divide-y divide-[color:var(--line)] text-sm"><li class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3 py-2"><span class="min-w-0"><a class="mono text-xs underline underline-offset-2" href="/evidence?ids=PSI-159-normal-L129&amp;test=PSI-159-normal-L129">PSI-159-normal-L129</a><span class="ml-2 text-ink-2">ACME CFI-G</span></span><span class="flex-none text-xs text-ink-2"><span class="relative inline " data-prov="cell:PSI-159:normal:L129:C5"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  " aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="34.1%. Show where this number comes from">34.1%</button></span> · <span class="relative inline " data-prov="cell:PSI-159:normal:L129:C7"><button type="button" class="num rounded-sm underline decoration-dotted decoration-transparent underline-offset-[3px] transition-colors hover:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)] focus-visible:decoration-[color:var(--ink-2)]  " aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="dialog